<title>MALAYSIA: Tekala stock suspended at firm's request.</title>
<headline>Tekala stock suspended at firm's request.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock of Malaysian timber concern Tekala Corp Bhd was suspended from Friday afternoon trading at the company's request, said an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The stock was last traded at 6.50 ringgit, up 1.0 ringgit and just below its morning high of 6.60. About 1.7 million shares were traded.  </p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
